Package: gixsiepy
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), git
Suggests: fonts-quicksand
Description: friendly native GTK4 interface for Git
 Open repositories, inspect changes, stage files, create commits, synchronize
 with a remote and browse recent history using the Git installed on the system.
 GixsiePy is written in Python and provides a soft, clear desktop interface.
